{"words": [{"text": "أَلَآ", "translation": "Beware"}, {"text": "إِنَّهُمْ", "translation": "indeed they"}, {"text": "هُمُ", "translation": "themselves"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُفْسِدُونَ", "translation": "(are) the ones who spread corruption"}, {"text": "وَلَـٰكِن", "translation": "[and] but"}, {"text": "لَّا", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "يَشْعُرُونَ", "translation": "they realize (it)"}], "sahih": "Unquestionably, it is they who are the corrupters, but they perceive [it] not."}